---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Me" description="A little bit about me, my interests, and my journey.">
    <div class="about-container">

        <div class="hero-orb">
            <div class="orb"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-card">
            <h1>About Me</h1>
            
            <p>Hey, I'm Komyl. My journey took a bit of a scenic route, I started out in medicine before making a sharp turn into the world of computing. I guess I've always been drawn to complex systems, whether it's the human body or a cryptographic algorithm.</p>
            <p>I'm fascinated by cryptography and the art of breaking things to find their weaknesses. It’s a passion that extends from software bugs to tinkering with hardware. This curiosity naturally led me to the world of financial markets and cryptocurrencies; I find the tokenomics and the tech behind them to be incredibly compelling puzzles.</p>
            <p>Outside of the digital world, I enjoy the strategic depth of chess, the logic of mathematics, and getting lost in research on whatever has captured my curiosity this week.</p>
            <p>Travel is a big part of my life; there's a unique thrill in exploring new places. I also have a deep appreciation for art and music. While I don't like putting myself in a box, I suppose "geek" comes pretty close.</p>
            <p>At my core, I'm driven by a strong belief in freedom in all its forms, from free speech and open-source software to a decentralized, open internet. Computers and networks have been my playground since I was a kid, especially the intricate dance of the internet and its security.</p>
            <p>I often write scripts for fun or for work, build software when inspiration strikes, and contribute to open-source projects that I find cool. This blog is one of my homes on the web, but you can find me in other places too.</p>

            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a href="/contact" class="button primary">Get in Touch</a>
                <a href="https://linktr.ee/komylf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button secondary">Find Me Elsewhere</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-container {
        padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 6) 0; /* Adjusted padding */
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 4);
    }

    .content-card {
        background-color: var(--glass-background);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        border-radius: var(--border-radius-large);
        padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 5);
    }
    
    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 3);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .content-card p {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 1.5em;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center; /* Center the buttons */
        gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2);
    }

    .button {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 14px 28px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: transform 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
        transform: scale(1.05);
    }
    .button.primary {
        background-color: var(--color-primary);
        color: white;
    }
    .button.secondary {
        background-color: var(--glass-border);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }
     .button.secondary:hover {
        background-color: var(--color-text-muted);
        color: var(--color-background);
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn-up {
        from {
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(20px);
        }
        to {
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
    }

    .animated-card {
        /* Apply the animation */
        animation: fadeIn-up 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94) both;
    }

    /* Stagger the animation for the second card (buttons) */
    .animated-card:nth-of-type(2) {
        animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }
</style>